WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:07.140
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.943
Good morning!

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.145
To my dearest wife.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.481
Ex-wife.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.018
It's already been a year
since our divorce.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.652
As vice principal,

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:23.023
my daily life has been spent
solving issues on campus,

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.525
steadily making my way
toward becoming Principal.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.465
It hurts!

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.103
Hey, Onizuka!

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.875
I just bought this scooter…

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.614
I'll see that guy fired,
even if it kills me!

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:57.023
To my dearest wife.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.093
My terrible summer cold
has finally cleared up.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.963
I was getting excited to run
full throttle into the second term…

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.900
But another major crisis struck.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.435
Wait, what is this?

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.904
HE'S BEEN FIRED
FROM ALL HIS PREVIOUS SCHOOLS

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.839
FOR USING VIOLENCE,
SEXUAL HARASSMENT, ETC.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.207
I WON'T TRUST HIM

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.008
Hey.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:18.278
Who the heck is still doing this?

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:22.082
I am.

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.121
I commend you for coming forward.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:32.692
I hate people who post slander online,

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.795
like throwing stones from a safe distance.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.865
Don't get defensive. Just explain.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.167
All of this is true, isn't it?

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.573
Yes.

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.408
I did get fired for those.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.076
No way…

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:58.918
Personally,

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:03.056
I don't think I did anything wrong.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:06.292
Some of the stuff I never even did.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.296
Like sexual harassment.
Or indecent behavior.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.066
What the heck?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.535
You're still playing dumb?

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.505
Everyone!

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:22.509
Are you sure you want someone like him
as our homeroom teacher?

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.678
I have nothing to feel guilty about,

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:29.616
but the student in question
hired her father's legal counsel

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.851
to uncover the truth,

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:35.688
and she's making a fuss,
saying she won't stop until I resign.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:39.325
What do you think I should do?

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:48.768
You haven't replied at all since that day…

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:53.306
If you're mad because Ms. Kashiwabara
visited me when I was sick,

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:56.176
there's nothing improper
going on between us.

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:06.219
Please believe me.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.994
What is the meaning of this?

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:18.064
You never told us about all of this.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:21.301
They only wrote all of this
to be sensational.

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.169
It's fake news. Fake news.

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:25.038
Who would believe you?

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:28.741
The information leaked to parents too,
and the phones have been ringing nonstop.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.743
To be frank, this is a real nuisance.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.578
See!

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:37.784
Hello, Seishin Academy.
Yes, this is a misunderstanding.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.353
-Well, since it's Mr. Onizuka…
-That's right.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.922
There must have been
a valid reason, right?

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:46.926
You've been completely corrupted
by him lately.

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:47.827
That's not true.

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.729
Well then, excuse me.

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:57.770
What on earth
do you plan to do, Principal?

00:03:58.404 --> 00:04:01.574
If we don't fire Onizuka immediately,
we can't do our jobs.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:03.443
Yes, that's true, but…

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.679
Vice Principal,
shouldn't we calm down a bit?

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:10.049
Mr. Onizuka hasn't been sued
by any of the schools.

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:12.819
And now, he's even highly rated
by most of the class.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:16.222
Because of this incident,
it has dropped to less than half again.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:18.491
What? No way! Show me.

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:23.096
When you hired Onizuka,

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:26.065
did you check his background
properly, Mr. Miyazawa?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.235
-Of course I did.
-Then why hire him?

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:34.440
I believe Mr. Onizuka is a teacher
who cares about the students

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.975
more than anyone else.

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.010
That's right.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:40.313
I don't care about your opinion.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.382
Report to your company

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.817
and have them dismiss him
as soon as possible.

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:48.888
I will report to the company, but I'll
explain that there is no need to fire him.

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:49.989
That's right.

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:51.424
What?

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:56.863
You used to be his student,
so you're Onizuka's yes-man, huh?

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:58.164
Right.

00:04:58.231 --> 00:05:01.801
Or maybe he has something on you?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.872
I know you are the vice principal,

00:05:06.439 --> 00:05:09.142
but I think there are things
you should and shouldn't say.

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:13.446
What's with that look?

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:16.549
Both of you calm down.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:19.118
We can work this out if we talk.

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:21.688
Why are you acting like a bystander?

00:05:21.754 --> 00:05:23.623
We're talking about you!

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.258
Please believe me.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.060
Stop using that tone!

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:27.994
-Believe me!
-Stop it!

00:06:55.348 --> 00:06:58.451
Unfortunately, Mr. Onizuka

00:06:58.518 --> 00:07:01.320
has been suspended
until the issue settles down.

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:03.156
-What?
-Suspended?

00:07:05.024 --> 00:07:06.058
Miss!

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:08.995
Onicchi will come back, right?

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:10.329
Of course.

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:12.799
Ayano, why did you do such a thing?

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:15.501
Despite how he looks,
Onicchi has a warm heart.

00:07:15.568 --> 00:07:18.471
Why don't you all snap out of it already?

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:20.873
How long are you going
to let him fool you?

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:22.642
Are you stupid?

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:24.076
What do you mean by that?

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:27.780
Do you find it fun making these posts,
trying to rile us up?

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.015
Answer us, Ayano!

00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:29.916
Answer us, Ayano!

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:31.184
-Stop it!
-Ayano!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:33.186
Everyone calm down.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:36.889
But honestly, having problems
occur week after week…

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:39.091
I just want a break.

00:07:39.158 --> 00:07:41.394
Besides, if this is true…

00:07:42.028 --> 00:07:43.129
I'm kind of scared.

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.096
Yeah, exactly.

00:07:44.163 --> 00:07:46.265
I'm telling you, Onicchi isn't like that!

00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:48.434
This is obviously fake news!

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:49.669
How can you be so sure?

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:50.803
Yeah!

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.705
Hey, what are you all doing?

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:54.807
Don't fight in class!

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:04.617
This is not good.
It's best we don't talk at school.

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:07.353
Just a little is fine.

00:08:11.023 --> 00:08:13.726
Mr. Soma Sato, what's wrong?

00:08:28.007 --> 00:08:31.110
Soma, is there anything bothering you?

00:08:32.144 --> 00:08:33.012
Not really.

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:37.850
The people you met at the school gate
the other day, who are they?

00:08:39.285 --> 00:08:41.320
They're my middle school classmates.

00:08:42.588 --> 00:08:43.990
Don't forget.

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:47.393
We have words at our disposal.

00:08:50.096 --> 00:08:51.330
What do you mean?

00:08:51.898 --> 00:08:54.901
If you're worrying about something,
won't you tell me?

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:58.170
I know a lot has happened,
and it's not easy to open up.

00:08:58.237 --> 00:09:01.841
But if you don't tell me,
I can't help you even if I want to.

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:07.313
You sound a bit like Onizuka,

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.481
Ms. Kashiwabara.

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:09.482
What?

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:11.617
You called my name without an honorific.

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:14.520
Your vibe has changed a bit too.

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:15.655
Really?

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:18.491
Well, do your best.

00:09:29.502 --> 00:09:30.336
Kotone.

00:09:31.437 --> 00:09:32.638
Ms. Kotone.

00:09:33.873 --> 00:09:35.107
Um…

00:09:39.478 --> 00:09:43.182
Are you dating anyone?

00:09:45.651 --> 00:09:48.788
Isn't this sexual harassment?

00:09:48.854 --> 00:09:50.289
How should I put it…

00:09:50.356 --> 00:09:52.858
You're level-headed,
so I was worried you might

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:55.161
try to solve your problems
all by yourself.

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:01.067
Instead of me,

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:04.303
shouldn't you worry about her?

00:10:20.319 --> 00:10:22.855
Hey, Ms. Ayano, what are you doing?

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:23.889
Nothing really.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.325
Hey, about Mr. Onizuka…

00:10:26.392 --> 00:10:29.428
If you have a complaint,
please use the chat. I'm busy.

00:10:38.838 --> 00:10:41.907
Bad rumors are spreading
faster and faster.

00:10:41.974 --> 00:10:44.577
Like how you used to be
a regular at S&amp;M clubs,

00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:47.313
did illegal side jobs,
and have a criminal record.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:51.817
This situation really represents
our social media society.

00:10:51.884 --> 00:10:55.454
Don't sound so carefree.
We need to explain this to the parents!

00:10:56.088 --> 00:10:57.723
Before that, Ryunosuke.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.058
What is it?

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:02.828
Sorry for making you go through that.

00:11:03.629 --> 00:11:04.764
-What?
-Well, you know…

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.900
The Vice Principal
said you had dirt I was exploiting,

00:11:07.967 --> 00:11:09.635
and all that terrible stuff.

00:11:10.736 --> 00:11:13.806
Even though you're the cleanest
and most upright man I know.

00:11:16.642 --> 00:11:17.543
Mr. Onizuka.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.513
What's with the scary face?

00:11:21.747 --> 00:11:24.116
Actually, I…

00:11:29.088 --> 00:11:30.523
Mr. Onizuka.

00:11:30.589 --> 00:11:32.925
What's wrong, Ms. Kashiwabara?

00:11:32.992 --> 00:11:35.294
-I need to talk to you about something.
-Okay.

00:11:37.096 --> 00:11:39.131
Well,

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:44.670
actually, I've recently realized
how difficult being a teacher is.

00:11:45.738 --> 00:11:46.772
Why?

00:11:46.839 --> 00:11:51.977
Until now, I thought I'd quit soon anyway,
so I acted without fearing anything.

00:11:52.812 --> 00:11:53.979
Okay. And?

00:11:55.114 --> 00:11:56.949
Well, so…

00:11:57.516 --> 00:12:01.253
Right, I'll be leaving then.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.655
Oh, Mr. Miyazawa.

00:12:03.522 --> 00:12:05.191
Yes, what is it?

00:12:05.257 --> 00:12:07.526
Are you really not seeing anyone?

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.498
I'm not.

00:12:13.065 --> 00:12:14.033
Then…

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.402
Ms. Kashiwabara, do you like Ryunosuke?

00:12:16.469 --> 00:12:17.603
No, it's not like that.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.671
Then what's wrong?

00:12:18.738 --> 00:12:20.272
I'm telling you, it's…

00:12:21.006 --> 00:12:24.477
I'll tell you once
Ms. Ayano's problem is solved.

00:12:28.647 --> 00:12:30.316
You really are a ladies' man.

00:12:30.382 --> 00:12:32.017
I don't know anything!

00:12:36.822 --> 00:12:39.959
Shouldn't we practice our drills?

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:44.430
I'm not in the mood for that.
I'm worried about Onicchi.

00:12:48.334 --> 00:12:49.368
Ayano.

00:12:50.636 --> 00:12:52.438
The atmosphere is terrible because of you.

00:12:52.505 --> 00:12:55.040
What? What are you talking about?

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:56.542
It's all Onizuka's fault, isn't it?

00:12:56.609 --> 00:13:00.513
You say that, but you're still posting
a ton of bad things about Onicchi!

00:13:02.148 --> 00:13:04.350
I've stopped acting like a good kid.

00:13:05.351 --> 00:13:07.219
So let me say this.

00:13:07.853 --> 00:13:11.957
Do you seriously think our school
will make the Drill Team official?

00:13:13.159 --> 00:13:14.093
It's too lame!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:16.262
What are you so upset about?

00:13:16.762 --> 00:13:21.100
You're pretty, your family is rich,
and everyone in the class liked you!

00:13:21.901 --> 00:13:25.538
A carefree person like you
could never understand my pain.

00:13:25.604 --> 00:13:27.973
What? What's that?
You act so high and mighty.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.508
That goes for you too!

00:13:29.575 --> 00:13:31.343
-What are you doing?
-Yuukichi!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.344
Hey!

00:13:33.145 --> 00:13:35.514
You're the one who always acts so cocky!

00:13:35.581 --> 00:13:38.250
You too! I don't understand you at all!

00:13:38.317 --> 00:13:39.585
Ayano!

00:13:39.652 --> 00:13:42.788
If you have any problems,
we will help you out.

00:13:42.855 --> 00:13:45.391
What? Now you're being condescending too!

00:13:45.457 --> 00:13:46.525
So annoying!

00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:48.661
Don't say that. Aren't we classmates?

00:13:50.129 --> 00:13:52.565
I've never thought of us
that way even once.

00:13:53.132 --> 00:13:53.966
What?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.101
Just so you know,

00:13:56.735 --> 00:13:59.538
I was never supposed to be
at a school like this!

00:14:14.553 --> 00:14:16.088
I'm home.

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:47.620
Ayano, I'm coming in.

00:14:47.686 --> 00:14:48.787
Wait a minute.

00:14:48.854 --> 00:14:51.857
What are you doing?
It's almost time for your piano lesson.

00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:02.835
Honestly,

00:15:03.335 --> 00:15:06.972
if you had gotten into my old high school,
we wouldn't have wasted that uniform.

00:15:07.039 --> 00:15:09.408
How long are you going
to keep saying that?

00:15:10.409 --> 00:15:14.947
We were wrong to buy that uniform
before she even passed the exam.

00:15:15.014 --> 00:15:17.716
What? Are you saying it's my fault?

00:15:17.783 --> 00:15:21.854
I'm telling you
to understand Ayano's feelings.

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:24.823
I understand her feelings
much better than you do!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.091
Hey, Ayano.

00:15:26.158 --> 00:15:28.961
Shall we go shopping on my next day off?

00:15:29.028 --> 00:15:30.930
I'll buy you the clothes you want.

00:15:31.563 --> 00:15:32.398
Thank you.

00:15:32.464 --> 00:15:34.533
You're spoiling her again.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:37.336
You should stop finding fault
with everything I do!

00:15:37.403 --> 00:15:40.572
That's because you keep doing things
that get you criticized!

00:15:40.639 --> 00:15:42.942
What? Why can't I buy her clothes?

00:15:45.878 --> 00:15:48.614
It's time to decide what we want
to do for the culture festival.

00:15:48.681 --> 00:15:50.549
Does anyone have any good ideas?

00:15:52.818 --> 00:15:54.954
By the way, Mr. Onizuka said…

00:15:56.455 --> 00:16:00.092
"A haunted house
or a cosplay cafe would be good."

00:16:01.093 --> 00:16:02.027
That's his opinion.

00:16:03.762 --> 00:16:06.532
We can't listen to someone
who isn't our homeroom teacher.

00:16:06.598 --> 00:16:07.800
What are you saying?

00:16:08.334 --> 00:16:10.169
Onicchi is still
our homeroom teacher, right?

00:16:10.235 --> 00:16:12.071
Just accept it already.

00:16:12.137 --> 00:16:14.673
That man isn't qualified to be a teacher.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.208
And you!

00:16:16.275 --> 00:16:18.444
Stop spreading fake rumors already.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:21.080
Please stop fighting. I'm begging you.

00:16:35.294 --> 00:16:36.228
ONE NEW POST

00:16:38.931 --> 00:16:40.632
THE TRUTH ABOUT AYANO ASHIDA

00:16:42.301 --> 00:16:43.769
Wait, what is this?

00:16:43.836 --> 00:16:45.571
DID SHE BULLY A CLASSMATE
IN MIDDLE SCHOOL?

00:16:45.637 --> 00:16:47.172
SHE LIVES LAVISHLY

00:16:47.239 --> 00:16:49.375
DID SHE BULLY A CLASSMATE
IN MIDDLE SCHOOL?

00:16:49.441 --> 00:16:51.744
SHE LIVES LAVISHLY
LIKE EVERY DAY IS HER BIRTHDAY

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:54.113
SHE GOT INTO SEISHIN ACADEMY
BECAUSE HER PARENTS KNEW SOMEONE

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.415
Hey, who is spreading this fake info?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.788
It was you, wasn't it?

00:17:03.756 --> 00:17:05.224
What? No idea.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.258
Don't play dumb.

00:17:06.825 --> 00:17:08.794
I wouldn't. I'm not a coward like you!

00:17:08.861 --> 00:17:10.562
-What?
-Stop it.

00:17:10.629 --> 00:17:13.599
Both of you calm down. I did it.

00:17:13.665 --> 00:17:15.734
What? Don't mess with me!

00:17:15.801 --> 00:17:16.835
You too.

00:17:17.503 --> 00:17:19.405
Now do you understand how Onicchi feels?

00:17:19.471 --> 00:17:22.408
Even so, there's no need to go that far!

00:17:22.474 --> 00:17:25.744
Aren't you all trusting Onizuka too much?

00:17:26.412 --> 00:17:29.415
You don't know anything about Onicchi,
so don't go judging him!

00:17:30.282 --> 00:17:35.087
-You can't trust Onizuka too much!
-What do you even know?

00:17:35.154 --> 00:17:37.990
Everyone, calm down a bit. Hey!

00:17:39.024 --> 00:17:41.260
Give me a break already.

00:17:44.096 --> 00:17:45.864
Hey!

00:17:46.565 --> 00:17:49.601
The whole school can hear you.

00:17:49.668 --> 00:17:51.270
Sit down.

00:17:53.639 --> 00:17:56.608
Onicchi, tell these guys to behave!

00:17:57.376 --> 00:17:58.844
Sure, but…

00:17:59.678 --> 00:18:05.150
Why are you doing something
that tears the class apart, Yuu?

00:18:05.217 --> 00:18:06.552
Wait,

00:18:07.486 --> 00:18:09.388
why am I being scolded here?

00:18:09.455 --> 00:18:14.293
Didn't you start the Drill Team
because you wanted to unite the class?

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.095
That's true, but…

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:28.307
What is this?

00:18:28.874 --> 00:18:33.579
I wrote down the detailed reasons
why I quit my previous schools.

00:18:37.149 --> 00:18:39.451
FIRED FOR BEATING UP PUNKS
FROM ANOTHER SCHOOL

00:18:39.518 --> 00:18:41.820
USED THE PRINCIPAL'S CAR TO TAKE
THE CLASS ON A GRADUATION TRIP

00:18:41.887 --> 00:18:44.022
TOOK A TRUANT KID
TO THE GRADUATION CEREMONY

00:18:44.089 --> 00:18:45.157
HELPED SAVE THE KARATE CLUB

00:18:45.224 --> 00:18:48.026
What is to say you didn't
make all of these up?

00:18:48.594 --> 00:18:51.663
I'll let you be the judge.
Think and decide for yourself.

00:18:52.231 --> 00:18:52.898
What?

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.803
If you still won't trust me,

00:18:58.904 --> 00:19:00.105
then I…

00:19:01.373 --> 00:19:05.844
will quit being this class's homeroom
teacher, as well as the school.

00:19:06.545 --> 00:19:08.547
-No way.
-What?

00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:13.385
EXPOSED THE HEAD OF YEAR'S HARASSMENT

00:19:14.119 --> 00:19:15.420
Pass these around.

00:19:15.487 --> 00:19:17.222
WAS BEING REASSIGNED TO HOKKAIDO

00:19:17.289 --> 00:19:19.091
HAD A GAMBLING BOOTH AT CULTURE FESTIVAL

00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:22.928
No way we can believe something like this!

00:19:22.995 --> 00:19:26.298
Please read it properly.
I spent all night writing it.

00:19:26.365 --> 00:19:29.635
The handwriting is messy,
full of typos and missing words…

00:19:29.701 --> 00:19:32.437
Give up on being a teacher already!

00:19:32.504 --> 00:19:36.808
It's ridiculous for a former bike gang
member to become a teacher anyway.

00:19:37.576 --> 00:19:39.077
Wait, what's with that?

00:19:39.144 --> 00:19:40.579
Vice Principal.

00:19:40.646 --> 00:19:41.813
What is it, Principal?

00:19:42.915 --> 00:19:46.585
Are former bike gang members
not allowed to become teachers?

00:19:47.152 --> 00:19:47.819
What?

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.492
What's gotten into you, Principal?

00:19:53.559 --> 00:19:54.693
Well,

00:19:55.961 --> 00:20:00.732
you speak as if former gang members
aren't human beings.

00:20:01.233 --> 00:20:03.268
What happened to the Principal?

00:20:03.335 --> 00:20:05.637
I've never seen him like this before.

00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:07.673
I didn't mean it like that…

00:20:08.373 --> 00:20:10.742
Why are you defending them so much?

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.882
Oh, that's because…

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.685
It's nothing.

00:20:19.751 --> 00:20:20.819
-What?
-I'm sorry.

00:20:20.886 --> 00:20:23.088
No, it's not nothing…

00:20:23.155 --> 00:20:25.023
He was clenching his fists…

00:20:54.353 --> 00:20:55.320
Everyone.

00:20:56.288 --> 00:20:57.522
Did you read it?

00:21:01.093 --> 00:21:05.564
Who here believes in me?

00:21:22.314 --> 00:21:23.348
What?

00:21:23.982 --> 00:21:24.983
What is this?

00:21:26.652 --> 00:21:29.488
Why do you all believe a guy like him?

00:21:29.554 --> 00:21:31.456
You're so easily fooled. Are you stupid?

00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:37.329
There isn't a single adult in this world
worth respecting!

00:21:37.396 --> 00:21:41.566
They act all nice and proper,
but in the end, they're sneaky and dirty.

00:21:43.302 --> 00:21:44.369
It's over!

00:21:44.436 --> 00:21:46.438
For this school, and this country!

00:21:46.505 --> 00:21:48.440
Heading toward inequality
and declining birth rates,

00:21:48.507 --> 00:21:50.976
never taking measures
against global warming,

00:21:51.043 --> 00:21:53.011
not to mention nuclear weapons and war.

00:21:53.078 --> 00:21:55.447
Why can't they understand
that killing is wrong?

00:21:55.514 --> 00:21:57.549
What do they think our future even is?

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:02.821
To be clear,

00:22:03.388 --> 00:22:06.458
I don't respect you at all.

00:22:07.492 --> 00:22:10.595
You'll be dead in 20 or 30 years anyway,

00:22:10.662 --> 00:22:14.232
so can you stop
getting in the way of our lives?

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:18.670
Hey.

00:22:18.737 --> 00:22:19.938
Ayano!

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:25.043
I was also once a high school student
without any charm like you,

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.878
so I understand what you want to say…

00:22:27.512 --> 00:22:31.450
But you're just taking online information
at face value, without thinking,

00:22:31.516 --> 00:22:35.187
like people who spread hoaxes
about "those invading foreigners!"

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:42.294
Wait, what are you doing?

00:22:42.361 --> 00:22:43.562
Enough already.

00:22:43.628 --> 00:22:45.564
Talking any further is useless.

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:46.732
Ayano, wait a minute!

00:22:46.798 --> 00:22:49.034
Shut up!

00:22:52.571 --> 00:22:54.740
This is why
I didn't want to go to this school!

00:23:10.756 --> 00:23:11.490
Ayano.

00:23:12.657 --> 00:23:13.592
What?

00:23:17.429 --> 00:23:19.097
Are you okay?

00:23:19.998 --> 00:23:22.434
What? Are you pretending to care?

00:23:22.501 --> 00:23:24.269
It's not like that.

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.373
We went to the same
middle school, after all.

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:30.242
Don't tell me

00:23:31.443 --> 00:23:35.313
you'll tell everyone I failed my high
school entrance exam and got held back?

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:37.015
I wouldn't do that.

00:23:38.016 --> 00:23:39.384
Soma!

00:23:39.451 --> 00:23:41.486
-Hey!
-Yo!

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.889
You still hang out with those guys?

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.024
It's not like that.

00:23:46.091 --> 00:23:48.593
Huh? We've never seen her before.

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:50.929
Are you guys in love?

00:23:50.996 --> 00:23:52.230
As if.

00:23:54.099 --> 00:23:55.133
Quit it…

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.769
-What the heck?
-Don't get cocky!

00:24:03.508 --> 00:24:05.710
ASHIDA

00:24:11.983 --> 00:24:15.187
What are you doing? Do it properly!

00:24:15.787 --> 00:24:16.855
I'm sorry.

00:24:18.523 --> 00:24:21.059
You haven't been concentrating at all.

00:24:21.726 --> 00:24:23.128
Did something happen at school?

00:24:24.496 --> 00:24:25.897
So you still don't know…

00:24:26.731 --> 00:24:27.566
What?

00:24:30.202 --> 00:24:32.537
It's nothing really.

00:24:35.340 --> 00:24:37.642
Are you actually studying?

00:24:37.709 --> 00:24:40.846
You know you can't let
your grades drop any further, right?

00:24:42.280 --> 00:24:43.215
Yes.

00:24:49.187 --> 00:24:51.823
FOREIGNERS SHOULD JUST
GO BACK TO THEIR COUNTRIES

00:24:53.024 --> 00:24:56.194
PEOPLE ON WELFARE SHOULDN'T KEEP DOGS

00:24:58.430 --> 00:25:01.566
IT'S OBVIOUS SHE HAD SURGERY
DONE ON HER FACE

00:25:30.562 --> 00:25:31.496
Good morning.

00:25:31.563 --> 00:25:32.731
Good morning.

00:25:34.633 --> 00:25:35.667
Good morning.

00:25:37.269 --> 00:25:39.170
EIFUKU HIGH SCHOOL

00:25:41.973 --> 00:25:42.641
Good morning.

00:25:43.909 --> 00:25:44.743
Good morning.

00:25:45.377 --> 00:25:46.778
-Good morning.
-Good morning.

00:25:54.686 --> 00:25:56.955
-Good morning.
-Morning!

00:25:59.691 --> 00:26:02.093
Good morning.

00:26:03.929 --> 00:26:05.130
Who are you?

00:26:05.964 --> 00:26:06.965
What?

00:26:07.032 --> 00:26:10.268
You don't look familiar.
What year and class are you in?

00:26:12.270 --> 00:26:13.538
About that…

00:26:13.605 --> 00:26:16.608
I think this girl
is sneaking into our school!

00:26:16.675 --> 00:26:18.910
-You serious?
-For real?

00:26:22.814 --> 00:26:25.717
You are not from our school, right?

00:26:26.418 --> 00:26:27.619
What are you doing here?

00:26:30.522 --> 00:26:32.891
Don't stay quiet. Please explain.

00:26:34.826 --> 00:26:35.860
I…

00:26:36.428 --> 00:26:39.130
Hello there, everyone!

00:26:39.197 --> 00:26:41.366
How's it going?

00:26:41.433 --> 00:26:44.603
Let's make today a good day too!

00:26:44.669 --> 00:26:47.639
Excuse me, who are you?

00:26:48.139 --> 00:26:51.576
I'm Eikichi Onizuka, her homeroom teacher.

00:26:51.643 --> 00:26:54.279
And what are you doing at our school?

00:26:54.346 --> 00:26:56.548
Well, how should I put it…

00:26:57.682 --> 00:26:59.684
It's a punishment game!

00:26:59.751 --> 00:27:01.086
A punishment game?

00:27:01.152 --> 00:27:01.987
Yes.

00:27:02.053 --> 00:27:04.756
Your school uniform is just so cute,

00:27:04.823 --> 00:27:08.927
so the loser has to wear it
and walk one lap around this school.

00:27:08.994 --> 00:27:11.396
I'm glad I didn't lose. Right, Ayano?

00:27:11.963 --> 00:27:13.365
Yeah, right.

00:27:15.467 --> 00:27:16.601
-We have to run.
-Huh?

00:27:16.668 --> 00:27:18.470
-We have to run.
-What?

00:27:19.571 --> 00:27:20.605
Stop right there!

00:27:27.779 --> 00:27:30.949
Like I said, this is a misunderstanding!

00:27:33.418 --> 00:27:36.254
Huh? You're not going to look?

00:27:36.321 --> 00:27:38.089
Please follow us to the staff room.

00:27:39.024 --> 00:27:40.258
Right.

00:27:40.792 --> 00:27:42.027
But, I…

00:27:42.927 --> 00:27:44.596
It hurts!

00:27:44.663 --> 00:27:45.797
Hey, what's wrong?

00:27:46.398 --> 00:27:47.766
-Mr. Onizuka.
-What is it?

00:27:48.333 --> 00:27:49.434
-We're going to run.
-What?

00:28:19.297 --> 00:28:22.300
We should be fine now.

00:28:23.802 --> 00:28:24.769
Yeah.

00:28:29.974 --> 00:28:31.576
Don't worry.

00:28:31.643 --> 00:28:33.178
I won't tell anyone.

00:28:33.244 --> 00:28:35.513
Are you trying to make me feel indebted?

00:28:36.181 --> 00:28:37.549
It's not like that.

00:28:39.384 --> 00:28:41.052
Your mother was worried too.

00:28:41.119 --> 00:28:42.554
There's no way.

00:28:43.321 --> 00:28:44.856
Knowing her,

00:28:44.923 --> 00:28:48.626
she's definitely going to lecture me
for doing something so embarrassing.

00:28:49.728 --> 00:28:50.729
No way.

00:28:50.795 --> 00:28:51.863
It's true.

00:28:52.363 --> 00:28:55.934
She was a high-class lady
and had good grades.

00:28:56.835 --> 00:28:59.871
But I, her daughter,
failed to get into her school twice,

00:29:00.405 --> 00:29:02.006
so she was sorely disappointed.

00:29:03.708 --> 00:29:04.809
Ever since then,

00:29:05.510 --> 00:29:09.080
no matter how hard I tried
with piano or flower arrangement,

00:29:10.381 --> 00:29:12.050
she's never complimented me even once.

00:29:12.684 --> 00:29:16.721
Then, why don't you try
talking to your dad?

00:29:16.788 --> 00:29:19.724
I did. He's always kind.

00:29:19.791 --> 00:29:23.461
He always defends me, telling me
not to care about what Mom says.

00:29:25.363 --> 00:29:27.565
Sounds like a good father.

00:29:27.632 --> 00:29:28.967
Not at all.

00:29:30.235 --> 00:29:31.136
Why?

00:29:32.170 --> 00:29:35.673
He's been having an affair
with his subordinate at work for a while.

00:29:37.041 --> 00:29:39.778
After she found out,
Mom has been irritated every day.

00:29:41.212 --> 00:29:42.213
I see.

00:29:43.014 --> 00:29:48.486
You could have talked
to Ms. Kashiwabara or me…

00:29:49.721 --> 00:29:51.289
Even if I did that…

00:29:51.990 --> 00:29:54.325
Nothing good
has ever come from doing that!

00:30:00.698 --> 00:30:01.699
Huh?

00:30:04.269 --> 00:30:08.206
My club advisor back in middle school,
and my cram school teacher…

00:30:09.207 --> 00:30:11.209
At first they acted nice,

00:30:11.910 --> 00:30:14.512
but in the end, they sexually harassed me.

00:30:16.681 --> 00:30:19.551
When I talked to someone
I thought was my friend about it,

00:30:20.151 --> 00:30:21.719
she spilled my secret…

00:30:24.355 --> 00:30:26.791
The whole school ostracized me.

00:30:29.093 --> 00:30:32.096
Why do I have to keep
going through all this?

00:30:33.398 --> 00:30:34.332
Please,

00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:37.402
just leave me alone.

00:30:39.270 --> 00:30:43.675
I'm stupid,
so I can't get into a good university,

00:30:44.242 --> 00:30:46.911
but I'll never have to worry
about money in my life,

00:30:46.978 --> 00:30:49.747
and as long as I have
social media and AI, I'll be fine.

00:30:56.487 --> 00:30:57.455
I understand.

00:30:58.790 --> 00:30:59.791
Then,

00:31:01.125 --> 00:31:02.327
I have a proposal.

00:31:12.003 --> 00:31:14.205
SEISHIN HIGH SCHOOL

00:31:24.682 --> 00:31:27.552
You said you wanted me
to do something. What is it?

00:31:28.286 --> 00:31:29.387
I am going

00:31:29.921 --> 00:31:33.291
to hit Ayano now, so could you
record it on your smartphone?

00:31:33.358 --> 00:31:34.259
What?

00:31:34.325 --> 00:31:35.693
What are you talking about?

00:31:38.296 --> 00:31:40.365
You're being stupid.

00:31:40.431 --> 00:31:42.901
As your homeroom teacher,
let me hit you one last time.

00:31:44.235 --> 00:31:47.538
If you submit that video
to the school, I will no doubt

00:31:47.605 --> 00:31:48.706
get fired.

00:31:49.207 --> 00:31:50.808
Are you serious?

00:31:52.243 --> 00:31:55.079
In return, promise me one thing.

00:31:55.713 --> 00:31:56.881
What promise?

00:31:57.882 --> 00:31:59.918
Become smarter, Ayano.

00:32:00.518 --> 00:32:01.452
What?

00:32:02.420 --> 00:32:06.057
From now on,
stop saying that you are stupid.

00:32:07.825 --> 00:32:09.527
A real idiot

00:32:10.295 --> 00:32:12.964
is someone who doesn't believe
in their own potential.

00:32:15.667 --> 00:32:16.601
And…

00:32:17.735 --> 00:32:18.770
A long time ago,

00:32:19.337 --> 00:32:23.541
the chairperson who hired
a guy like me to teach at her school

00:32:23.608 --> 00:32:24.876
told me this.

00:32:25.877 --> 00:32:26.711
Okay.

00:32:27.312 --> 00:32:29.514
-You're hired.
-What?

00:32:29.580 --> 00:32:32.450
That person also told me this…

00:32:33.117 --> 00:32:34.485
"Onizuka.

00:32:35.119 --> 00:32:36.688
Children make mistakes.

00:32:37.388 --> 00:32:41.025
A child who doesn't
make mistakes learns nothing.

00:32:41.626 --> 00:32:43.761
A truly smart person

00:32:44.462 --> 00:32:47.198
is someone who lives each day
with all their might,

00:32:47.265 --> 00:32:51.836
is always smiling and honest,
and can take pride in themselves."

00:32:56.674 --> 00:32:57.642
Ayano.

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:01.879
I know you've been
through a lot of terrible things

00:33:02.714 --> 00:33:05.216
and can't trust anyone,

00:33:06.050 --> 00:33:09.654
but if you get desperate
and spend all your time on social media,

00:33:09.721 --> 00:33:12.357
nothing good will come out of it.

00:33:13.925 --> 00:33:15.860
You probably don't know this,

00:33:16.461 --> 00:33:19.864
but everyone in our class is also fighting
through pain and worries

00:33:19.931 --> 00:33:23.468
they couldn't tell anyone about,
living each day with all their might.

00:33:24.068 --> 00:33:27.805
So, you should talk to them more.

00:33:28.439 --> 00:33:31.876
I think they'll be a bigger help
to you than social media.

00:33:34.412 --> 00:33:37.348
Both of you are lecturing me,
so high and mighty.

00:33:40.551 --> 00:33:43.654
Hurry up. Weren't you going
to film yourself hitting me?

00:33:46.657 --> 00:33:47.492
Yes.

00:33:50.828 --> 00:33:52.597
Ms. Kashiwabara. Do it.

00:33:53.398 --> 00:33:54.432
Are you sure?

00:33:54.499 --> 00:33:56.401
Could you film it from around here?

00:33:56.467 --> 00:33:57.301
What?

00:34:01.873 --> 00:34:02.907
Ayano.

00:34:04.008 --> 00:34:04.909
Here I go.

00:34:07.879 --> 00:34:09.547
Just once, okay?

00:34:12.750 --> 00:34:16.187
Miss, let me know
when you start recording.

00:34:16.254 --> 00:34:17.755
Oh, okay.

00:34:19.157 --> 00:34:20.825
All right, go ahead.

00:34:22.794 --> 00:34:25.296
Grit your teeth, Ayano.

00:34:25.363 --> 00:34:27.165
Just hurry up already.

00:34:29.133 --> 00:34:30.134
Here I go.

00:34:47.485 --> 00:34:48.686
I recorded it.

00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:02.166
The rest is up to you.

00:35:11.676 --> 00:35:13.478
Good morning.

00:35:20.418 --> 00:35:21.686
Ayano!

00:35:23.921 --> 00:35:24.789
What?

00:35:25.456 --> 00:35:27.692
Sorry about the other day. I went too far.

00:35:29.594 --> 00:35:31.829
It's fine.

00:35:32.396 --> 00:35:33.698
Don't quit school, okay?

00:35:34.265 --> 00:35:35.166
What?

00:35:35.733 --> 00:35:40.471
I have also wished
I had gone to a different school.

00:35:42.073 --> 00:35:43.774
So I understand how you feel.

00:35:46.344 --> 00:35:47.178
But…

00:35:48.479 --> 00:35:50.748
everyone in our class is a good person.

00:36:00.324 --> 00:36:01.159
Morning!

00:36:01.225 --> 00:36:02.193
Good morning.

00:36:04.595 --> 00:36:06.063
So now,

00:36:06.130 --> 00:36:09.567
I think it's really great
that I came to Seishin High.

00:36:11.602 --> 00:36:15.973
Thanks to Onicchi and Ms. Kashiwabara,
I was able to become close with everyone…

00:36:18.943 --> 00:36:21.078
I'm really happy.

00:36:28.019 --> 00:36:29.954
I have to go to the staff room.

00:36:36.594 --> 00:36:38.729
STAFF ROOM

00:36:38.796 --> 00:36:42.166
Why haven't you fired
that problematic teacher yet?

00:36:42.233 --> 00:36:46.337
Our daughter tried so hard
to expose his true self to everyone!

00:36:46.404 --> 00:36:47.772
Don't you see it?

00:36:47.838 --> 00:36:52.710
I've also been asking the principal
for disciplinary action…

00:36:52.777 --> 00:36:53.844
No, but…

00:36:54.612 --> 00:36:58.516
most of the students in the class
said they believe in Mr. Onizuka.

00:36:58.583 --> 00:37:01.652
That's obviously because
they were talked into it!

00:37:01.719 --> 00:37:04.956
There's no way children
can make a rational judgment.

00:37:05.022 --> 00:37:06.891
Principal, make a decision.

00:37:07.692 --> 00:37:08.693
Yes.

00:37:11.696 --> 00:37:13.197
Mr. Onizuka.

00:37:13.264 --> 00:37:15.066
Oh, yes. What is it?

00:37:15.666 --> 00:37:18.703
Unbelievable. Were you sleeping?

00:37:18.769 --> 00:37:20.805
What a total piece of work.

00:37:20.871 --> 00:37:23.274
Principal, hurry up
with the disciplinary action.

00:37:29.513 --> 00:37:30.715
Yes…

00:37:31.249 --> 00:37:32.950
It's very unfortunate,

00:37:33.884 --> 00:37:36.454
but our Seishin High…

00:37:40.224 --> 00:37:41.158
No way!

00:37:41.225 --> 00:37:42.193
Principal!

00:37:44.095 --> 00:37:46.130
Look at this.

00:37:46.631 --> 00:37:48.933
THE TRUTH ABOUT EIKICHI ONIZUKA

00:37:49.500 --> 00:37:51.669
You've gone and done it now, Onizuka!

00:37:51.736 --> 00:37:53.604
What did you do to my daughter?

00:37:53.671 --> 00:37:56.073
And you call yourself a teacher?

00:37:56.140 --> 00:37:57.608
Wait a minute.

00:37:58.175 --> 00:38:00.778
It looks like there's more to it.

00:38:02.780 --> 00:38:03.648
What is this?

00:38:03.714 --> 00:38:05.349
THIS VIDEO IS FAKE

00:38:06.017 --> 00:38:07.385
Who did this?

00:38:07.451 --> 00:38:08.653
SORRY FOR SPREADING MISINFORMATION

00:38:08.719 --> 00:38:09.887
It was me.

00:38:10.554 --> 00:38:11.722
Ayano!

00:38:13.624 --> 00:38:15.026
What is the meaning of this?

00:38:15.092 --> 00:38:20.231
Mr. Onizuka said if I posted that video,
I could get him fired,

00:38:21.966 --> 00:38:23.801
but he didn't actually hit me.

00:38:29.540 --> 00:38:30.908
Mr. Onizuka

00:38:31.509 --> 00:38:36.147
tried to save me, even if it meant
making himself out to be the bad guy.

00:38:37.648 --> 00:38:40.217
When I did something stupid
at Mom's old school,

00:38:40.885 --> 00:38:43.788
he led me by the hand as we ran away.

00:38:46.624 --> 00:38:48.359
His hand was really warm.

00:39:01.005 --> 00:39:01.939
I figured,

00:39:02.807 --> 00:39:06.377
if it was him, no matter what happened,
he would listen to my worries.

00:39:09.046 --> 00:39:12.717
Unlike you two who only showed up
after all this time, acting all arrogant.

00:39:13.818 --> 00:39:15.119
But you know,

00:39:15.920 --> 00:39:17.588
I was even worse.

00:39:18.989 --> 00:39:22.526
I didn't study or do club activities,
and I even skipped cram school,

00:39:24.795 --> 00:39:27.264
all to spend time trashing people
on social media.

00:39:32.136 --> 00:39:33.471
But from now on,

00:39:34.305 --> 00:39:37.842
I want to think hard about lots
of things and become smart.

00:39:39.009 --> 00:39:41.412
I won't do whatever Mom
wants of me anymore,

00:39:41.479 --> 00:39:43.948
and I won't become
a hypocrite like Dad either.

00:39:45.583 --> 00:39:47.885
Living each day with all my might,

00:39:48.853 --> 00:39:51.822
always smiling, and being honest…

00:39:54.492 --> 00:39:57.027
I want to be a person
who can take pride in myself.

00:40:10.608 --> 00:40:12.042
CLASS 1-B

00:40:12.109 --> 00:40:16.614
And so, Mr. Onizuka has returned
as your homeroom teacher.

00:40:23.954 --> 00:40:26.424
Welcome back!

00:40:26.490 --> 00:40:27.925
Good for you, Onicchi.

00:40:28.692 --> 00:40:30.694
Sorry for making you worry.

00:40:32.296 --> 00:40:36.400
More importantly, it seems Ayano
has something she wants to say.

00:40:41.739 --> 00:40:46.210
Everyone, I'm sorry
for causing you so much trouble.

00:40:50.848 --> 00:40:51.715
You see,

00:40:52.249 --> 00:40:55.686
I failed my high school entrance exam,
so I'm one year older than you.

00:40:56.253 --> 00:40:59.223
Until now, though I was smiling
on the outside,

00:40:59.290 --> 00:41:01.492
deep down I secretly looked down on you.

00:41:02.226 --> 00:41:05.896
"No way these kids
could understand how I feel."

00:41:06.797 --> 00:41:07.798
That's awful!

00:41:08.699 --> 00:41:09.633
Awful!

00:41:09.700 --> 00:41:11.101
-Meanie!
-How awful!

00:41:11.168 --> 00:41:12.269
Not cool!

00:41:12.336 --> 00:41:13.370
You're the worst!

00:41:13.437 --> 00:41:14.805
But I was wrong.

00:41:15.473 --> 00:41:17.141
Age doesn't matter.

00:41:18.042 --> 00:41:19.743
I'm not alone,

00:41:20.478 --> 00:41:23.948
and everyone here is a real friend.

00:41:25.916 --> 00:41:27.585
I finally realized it.

00:41:28.452 --> 00:41:32.656
So could you please
let me be your classmate once more?

00:41:34.325 --> 00:41:35.726
Please.

00:41:38.629 --> 00:41:39.797
Okay!

00:41:44.201 --> 00:41:47.304
All right, then what should
her nickname be?

00:41:47.905 --> 00:41:49.173
How about Queen or Princess?

00:41:49.240 --> 00:41:50.841
No way, that's too cliché.

00:41:50.908 --> 00:41:52.142
How about Troublemaker?

00:41:52.643 --> 00:41:54.645
-Just shut up already.
-Okay.

00:41:56.213 --> 00:41:57.047
Well…

00:41:57.114 --> 00:42:00.417
If possible,
I'd like to go with "Miss Seishin."

00:42:00.484 --> 00:42:02.419
What? Why?

00:42:02.987 --> 00:42:07.591
Are you trying to say
you're the prettiest in our school?

00:42:07.658 --> 00:42:09.360
No, that's not it.

00:42:09.426 --> 00:42:12.897
I just want to say that the high school
I'm meant to attend is this one.

00:42:13.464 --> 00:42:15.099
Then let's drop the "Miss"

00:42:15.733 --> 00:42:18.269
and just go with "Seishin."

00:42:19.770 --> 00:42:21.972
Okay, let's get along!

00:42:24.241 --> 00:42:25.075
Seishin.

00:42:26.277 --> 00:42:27.444
Same here,

00:42:29.380 --> 00:42:30.314
Yuukichi.

00:42:32.249 --> 00:42:35.352
All right, let's start homeroom.

00:42:42.393 --> 00:42:43.360
Finally,

00:42:44.695 --> 00:42:47.431
all of you are looking up
from your tablets

00:42:47.498 --> 00:42:49.033
and are looking my way.

00:42:52.336 --> 00:42:53.237
All right,

00:42:53.938 --> 00:42:57.441
now our class is truly a perfect number.

00:42:59.443 --> 00:43:02.580
Let's make today a good day too!

00:43:02.646 --> 00:43:04.248
Roger!

00:43:04.315 --> 00:43:05.449
Okie-dokie, artichokie!

00:43:05.516 --> 00:43:07.084
Okie-dokie, artichokie? So lame!

00:43:07.985 --> 00:43:11.088
Let's prepare for the festival.

00:43:11.155 --> 00:43:13.524
-Onicchi, how about a maid cafe?
-Sounds nice.

00:43:13.591 --> 00:43:15.326
Anything but that!

00:43:15.392 --> 00:43:16.293
Any other ideas?

00:43:16.860 --> 00:43:17.995
Bye!

00:43:22.800 --> 00:43:24.902
Who the hell rides something this uncool?

00:43:28.238 --> 00:43:29.306
Hey!

00:43:30.608 --> 00:43:32.476
You bastard! What are you doing?

00:43:32.543 --> 00:43:35.679
Wait, Vice Principal, was this yours?

00:43:35.746 --> 00:43:38.382
I was thinking, "You have good taste!"

00:43:38.449 --> 00:43:40.317
Maybe I should get one too!

00:43:40.384 --> 00:43:42.052
Don't try to flatter me!

00:43:42.853 --> 00:43:45.322
Don't get cocky
that you dodged being fired again.

00:43:45.389 --> 00:43:47.157
I'll get you fired sooner or later!

00:43:47.224 --> 00:43:48.792
I'll be fine.

00:43:48.859 --> 00:43:53.097
I got good ratings from everyone.
My class has no problems at all.

00:43:53.964 --> 00:43:55.232
Are you okay?

00:43:55.299 --> 00:43:56.133
Don't touch me.

00:43:56.834 --> 00:43:59.269
Mr. Onizuka! We got trouble!
Do you have a moment?

00:43:59.336 --> 00:44:00.170
Sure.

00:44:00.237 --> 00:44:01.639
-Hey, Onizuka!
-You're lame.

00:44:03.073 --> 00:44:04.274
Damn him…

00:44:04.842 --> 00:44:06.410
What's wrong, Ms. Kashiwabara?

00:44:06.477 --> 00:44:07.611
-Quiet!
-Okay.

00:44:11.482 --> 00:44:12.516
Be quiet!

00:44:18.188 --> 00:44:19.323
It's about those two.

00:44:19.390 --> 00:44:20.924
What are they doing?

00:44:20.991 --> 00:44:22.393
Apparently, they're dating.

00:44:22.459 --> 00:44:24.795
What? Seriously?

00:44:25.362 --> 00:44:27.364
I didn't know if I should
talk to you about it,

00:44:27.431 --> 00:44:29.700
but even if Mr. Miyazawa
isn't a psychopath,

00:44:29.767 --> 00:44:32.002
he may be playing
with Ms. Kotone's feelings…

00:44:32.069 --> 00:44:34.505
No way, not Ryunosuke.

00:44:34.571 --> 00:44:37.641
Anyway, as it's a delicate matter,
please handle it carefully.

00:44:38.742 --> 00:44:39.910
Understood.

00:44:43.247 --> 00:44:44.248
What?

00:44:44.314 --> 00:44:46.316
What are you guys doing? Ryunosuke!

00:44:46.383 --> 00:44:47.217
What is it?

00:44:47.284 --> 00:44:49.119
What the hell are you up to?!

00:44:53.424 --> 00:44:54.858
Are you dating?

00:44:54.925 --> 00:44:55.592
-Yes.
-No.

00:44:55.659 --> 00:44:56.994
I'm quitting high school.

00:44:57.061 --> 00:44:59.229
You bastard! You laid
your hands on my daughter!

00:44:59.296 --> 00:45:00.497
Hit me if you want to.

00:45:00.564 --> 00:45:03.801
Can you proudly call yourself
a Great Teacher?

00:45:03.867 --> 00:45:06.036
What on earth have you done?

00:45:06.103 --> 00:45:07.971
If you have any problems, rely on me.

00:45:08.038 --> 00:45:09.840
Let's do our best
for the culture festival!

00:45:09.907 --> 00:45:11.008
Yeah!

00:45:11.075 --> 00:45:14.211
I can understand what it's like to
single-mindedly love someone, though.

00:45:14.278 --> 00:45:16.180
I'm not a kid like you all.

00:45:16.246 --> 00:45:19.416
Wait a minute. I feel like something
like this happened before.

00:45:19.483 --> 00:45:21.952
I've also held back this whole time!

00:45:22.019 --> 00:45:22.986
Take this, bastard!

00:45:23.053 --> 00:45:25.989
I believe in a future where you both
are smiling happily together.

00:45:26.056 --> 00:45:27.024
Subtitle translation by: Nix S.